This project extends the preceding locally authored Danus Math Panel 1.0.0.
danus_rsi/transport.py adapts its transport, rubric, validation and isolation code.
The original twelve mathematics tasks are retained as public development data.
Source hashes are recorded in danus_rsi/data/foundation-provenance.json.

Danus upstream: https://github.com/frenzymath/Danus
Examined commit: 6d92e8d415933ca2ef52fd1a4da73fdfcd418f1c (Apache-2.0).
Danus is an external runtime dependency; its implementation is not bundled here.

Valency records are scholarly metadata retrieved from the connected service.
Paper links and attribution remain attached to each record. Inclusion is not
an endorsement, a verification of the paper's claims, or permission to copy
its full text. No third-party paper full text is redistributed.
